    {
      "id": "msg_0591_T25R0901_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello, hello!\n",
        "I am the official Name Rater!\r",
        "Want me to rate the nicknames of\n",
        "your Pokémon? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0591_T25R0901_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Which Pokémon’s nickname should\n",
        "I critique?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0591_T25R0901_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0}, is it? Hmm...\n",
        "That is a decent nickname!\r",
        "But, I can give it a nicer name?\n",
        "How about it? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0591_T25R0901_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "OK, then. What shall the new\n",
        "nickname be?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0591_T25R0901_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Done!\n",
        "How about that?\r",
        "From now on, this Pokémon\n",
        "shall be known as {STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0}!\r",
        "It is a better name than before,\n",
        "isn’t it?\f",
        "Good for you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0591_T25R0901_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Ah, good. I see.\n",
        "Do come visit again if you change\f",
        "your mind."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0591_T25R0901_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Done! From now on, this Pokémon\n",
        "shall be known as {STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0}!\r",
        "It looks no different from before?\n",
        "That’s just you!\f",
        "This is vastly superior!\f",
        "How fortunate for you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0591_T25R0901_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0}, is it?\n",
        "That is a truly impeccable nickname!\r",
        "Take good care of {STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0}!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0591_T25R0901_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Now, now.\n",
        "That is merely an Egg!"
      ]
    }
  ]
